## Decision hints (infer Cas vs Abs from the texts above — no external metadata)
- If condition/rules specify a definite replacement value when upstream changes → UPDATE_PRIMARY with the new sole primary text.
- If upstream changed but NO replacement value is declared in condition/rules → INVALIDATE (do not invent a new value).
- If the new memory only adds detail to WHEN/HOW the value would change (not an actual upstream change event), output ENRICH_CONDITION and merge into the condition text.
- If unrelated, output NO_ACTION.

